		}
		{
			description: [
				"A Naquadah Hohlraum filled with Naquadah Uranium Fuel will be necessary to start the Naquadah Reactor."
				""
				"To make Naquadah Uranium Fuel, you need Liquid Fluorinated Naquadah Uranium Fuel and Osmium in chemical form."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To get Osmium in chemical form, you need to make a setup like this:"
				"{image:kubejs:block/screen/naquadah_line_osmium_compressor width:100 height:100 align:center} "
				"{image:kubejs:block/screen/naquadah_line_osmium_compressor_sides width:150 height:150 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To fill the Hohlraum, put it inside a Chemical Tank containing Naquadah Uranium Fuel."
				""
				"{image:kubejs:block/screen/naquadah_line_hohlraum width:100 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
			]
			id: "4720028D12723450"
			rewards: [{
				id: "01E50AEEC137E9BA"
				item: "kubejs:infused_coin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "5DBE4C4015369086"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "mekanism_extras:naquadah_hohlraum"
					tag: {
						mekData: {
							GasTanks: [{
								Tank: 0b
								stored: {
									amount: 100L
									gasName: "mekanism_extras:naquadah_uranium_fuel"
								}
							}]
						}
					}
				}
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -8.625d
			y: -8.125d
