		}
		{
			description: [
				"To light, the Naquadah Reactor needs a 2GFE laser pulse aimed at the Laser Focus Matrix."
				""
				"To get a 2GFE laser in a reasonable amount of time, you can do a setup like this:"
				"{image:kubejs:block/screen/naq_laser_amplifiers width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
				"The last Laser Amplifier (the one nearest the Laser Focus Matrix) needs to be in redstone pulse mode so that it accumulates 2GFE then you decide when to release it with a button/lever."
			]
			id: "2EE2FEBB7EC53C47"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4E5B033AB1AC3A49"
				item: "kubejs:apotheotic_coin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2343EC930617C483"
					item: "mekanism:laser"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "2CAFD639A469326E"
					item: "mekanism:laser_amplifier"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			x: -11.125d
			y: -10.625d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"4720028D12723450"
				"2EE2FEBB7EC53C47"
				"7A822E0A7F810F44"
				"6535B870E9488FBB"
			]
			description: [
				"Before lighting it, you need to set the Injection Rate inside the reactor's GUI to at least 6 otherwise the reactor won't accept Water."
				""
				"We need Water in the Reactor for it to make Polonium Containing Steam."
				"{image:kubejs:block/screen/naq_water_change_to_6 width:100 height:80 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If the reactor is not hot enough i.e. it didn't get a 2GFE laser pulse, it will produce normal Steam."
				""
				"You have to get rid of that steam for it to start producing Polonium Containing Steam once hot enough."
			]
			id: "6F3A495685E2A643"
			rewards: [{
				id: "239D4E6DC67303BE"
				item: "kubejs:infused_coin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "7F259278A6669C65"
				title: "Light it !"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: -11.125d
			y: -8.125d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6F3A495685E2A643"]
			description: [
				"Here is the full precessing line from &7Polonium Containing Steam&r to &2Polonium&r."
				""
				"&7Polonium Containing Steam&r > &9Liquid Polonium Containing Solution&r"
				"[Rotary Condensentrator in Condensentrating mode]"
				""
				"&9Liquid Polonium Containing Solution&r > &aLiquid Polonium-208&r"
				"[Thermal Evaporation Plant]"
				""
				"&aLiquid Polonium-208&r > &3Polonium-208&r"
				"[Rotary Condensentrator in Decondensentrating mode]"
				""
				"&3Polonium-208&r > &2Polonium&r"
				"[Solar Neutron Activator]"
				""
				"All of those recipes (except &aLiquid Polonium-208&r) also have a corresponding recipe in the Event Horizon Antimatter Synthesizer (which is much much faster)."
				""
				"From there, you should probably use the &5Antimatter&r recipes in the Event Horizon Antimatter Synthesizer."
			]
